<title>USA: FGIC qualifies four issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies four issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>FGIC said Monday it qualified four issues for insurance slated for competitive sale today.</p>
<p>--Carroll Community School District, Iowa, $5.5 million of GO school bonds.</p>
<p>--Artesia Public School District #16, N.M., $5 million of GO school bonds.</p>
<p>--East Penn SD, Pa., $10 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Hudson School District, Wis., $16.9 million GO school bonds.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
